#
# Cursor names for the web viewer.
#
# The page asks for pseudo-encoding -524289 only when the browser can
# show its own pointer. A cursor whose last row spells a name then
# becomes that pointer. A touch browser does not ask, so this server
# sends the picture with the row already removed.
#
